cff-version: 1.2.0
title: epJSON Viewer
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
abstract: >-
  A browser-based 3D geometry viewer for EnergyPlus epJSON files. Renders model
  geometry directly from the simulation input, entirely client-side, with
  EnergyPlus-exact coordinate handling, a building/zone/surface model tree and
  interactive surface inspection.
authors:
  - family-names: Morales
    given-names: Richard Dean
    affiliation: "Energy and Materials in Infrastructure and Buildings (EMIB) Research Group, University of Antwerp"
    email: richarddean.morales@uantwerpen.be
license: Apache-2.0
url: "https://paladean.github.io/epjson-viewer/"
keywords:
  - EnergyPlus
  - epJSON
  - building energy simulation
  - urban building energy modelling
  - 3D visualization
  - building geometry
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-10"
